 "description": "A gated recurrent unit drawn flat: reset r and update z gates from x and h_prev, the candidate n = tanh(W_in·x + r ⊙ (W_hn·h_prev)), then h = (1 − z) ⊙ n + z ⊙ h_prev, with a Delay carrying h to the next step. Same parameters and outputs as nn.GRU(16, 64); a Linear reads 8 values out of every step, trained by mean squared error against a target sequence.",
